   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.01,
    "text": "Let's do game theory."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 2.01,
    "end": 5.01,
    "text": "Game theory is just a study of how to win games, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 5.01,
    "end": 6.41,
    "text": "It's a very general thing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 6.41,
    "end": 8.25,
    "text": "Let's do a thought experiment and just say,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 8.25,
    "end": 10.37,
    "text": "there's about a million people in the world, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 10.37,
    "end": 11.61,
    "text": "There's a million people in the world"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 11.61,
    "end": 14.61,
    "text": "all trying to win the game against each other,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 14.61,
    "end": 16.65,
    "text": "but only one can win."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 16.65,
    "end": 18.01,
    "text": "According to game theory,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 18.01,
    "end": 20.93,
    "text": "the best way to win a game is by,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 20.93,
    "end": 22.95,
    "text": "does anyone know?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 22.95,
    "end": 24.19,
    "text": "Cheating, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 24.19,
    "end": 25.59,
    "text": "If you follow the rules, you will never win a game,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 25.59,
    "end": 26.87,
    "text": "you have to cheat."
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 26.87,
    "end": 29.99,
    "text": "And in this game, the best way to win"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 29.99,
    "end": 34.58,
    "text": "is by coordinating with other people, right?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 34.58,
    "end": 35.9,
    "text": "Cause everyone's playing by himself."
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 35.9,
    "end": 38.14,
    "text": "So if you can work with other people,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 38.14,
    "end": 40.46,
    "text": "then that gives you a huge advantage over everyone else,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 40.46,
    "end": 41.3,
    "text": "right?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 41.3,
    "end": 43.18,
    "text": "The problem with this is,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 43.18,
    "end": 45.18,
    "text": "the moment that people start coordinating,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 45.18,
    "end": 48.58,
    "text": "it forces an arms race of coordination."
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 48.58,
    "end": 49.96,
    "text": "So maybe these two are working together,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 49.96,
    "end": 52.86,
    "text": "these four now are forced to work together."
   },
   {
    "id": "t26",
    "start": 52.86,
    "end": 56.74,
    "text": "Which now forces these five to work together."
   },
   {
    "id": "t27",
    "start": 56.74,
    "end": 59.06,
    "text": "If you are the first to work together,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t28",
    "start": 59.06,
    "end": 61.18,
    "text": "you get screwed in the process."
   },
   {
    "id": "t29",
    "start": 61.18,
    "end": 64.7,
    "text": "So if you cheat, you have to cheat secretly."
   },
   {
    "id": "t30",
    "start": 64.7,
    "end": 67.5,
    "text": "You have to coordinate without people knowing"
   },
   {
    "id": "t31",
    "start": 67.5,
    "end": 69.26,
    "text": "you're actually coordinating together."
   },
   {
    "id": "t32",
    "start": 69.26,
    "end": 71.06,
    "text": "You have to conspire secretly."
   },
   {
    "id": "t33",
    "start": 71.06,
    "end": 73.54,
    "text": "And there are different ways to collaborate secretly, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t34",
    "start": 73.54,
    "end": 75.86,
    "text": "So let's look at examples."
   },
   {
    "id": "t35",
    "start": 75.86,
    "end": 78.14,
    "text": "So family is one example, right?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t36",
    "start": 78.14,
    "end": 81.14,
    "text": "Another example is religion."
   },
   {
    "id": "t37",
    "start": 81.14,
    "end": 82.18,
    "text": "You have a leader."
   },
   {
    "id": "t38",
    "start": 82.18,
    "end": 87.66,
    "text": "If you have a similar race, ethnicity,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39",
    "start": 87.66,
    "end": 89.54,
    "text": "You have a simple language."
   },
   {
    "id": "t40",
    "start": 89.54,
    "end": 92.3,
    "text": "So these are examples of how you get people"
   },
   {
    "id": "t41",
    "start": 92.3,
    "end": 93.86,
    "text": "to coordinate together."
   },
   {
    "id": "t42",
    "start": 93.86,
    "end": 98.86,
    "text": "The problem is that these are all obvious to people,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t43",
    "start": 98.98,
    "end": 102.34,
    "text": "which forces them to do the same thing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t44",
    "start": 102.34,
    "end": 105.86,
    "text": "But there's a strategy that you can use"
   },
   {
    "id": "t45",
    "start": 105.86,
    "end": 108.34,
    "text": "that allows you to coordinate secretly"
   },
   {
    "id": "t46",
    "start": 108.34,
    "end": 109.82,
    "text": "and defeat all your enemies."
   },
   {
    "id": "t47",
    "start": 109.82,
    "end": 112.9,
    "text": "And this strategy is called transgression."
   },
   {
    "id": "t48",
    "start": 112.9,
    "end": 114.38,
    "text": "Transgression."
   },
   {
    "id": "t49",
    "start": 114.38,
    "end": 117.54,
    "text": "The breaking of taboos, the breaking of social norm,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t50",
    "start": 117.54,
    "end": 119.98,
    "text": "the breaking of social laws, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t51",
    "start": 119.98,
    "end": 121.66,
    "text": "So let's study this concept."
   },
   {
    "id": "t52",
    "start": 121.66,
    "end": 125.42,
    "text": "The theory is that the greater you transgress, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t53",
    "start": 125.42,
    "end": 127.1,
    "text": "This is the level of transgression."
   },
   {
    "id": "t54",
    "start": 127.1,
    "end": 129.5,
    "text": "The greater your cohesion,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t55",
    "start": 129.5,
    "end": 132.3,
    "text": "which leads to synchronicity, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t56",
    "start": 132.3,
    "end": 135.92,
    "text": "That's a theory I wanna propose to you, all right?"
   }
